@startuml
title Figure 1 — Architectural context schematic — system boundary and external dependencies
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 60

actor "Customer Care\nOperator" as Operator
rectangle "Customer Activity Analytics\nreference application" as System {
  component "React operator UI" as UI
  component "Protected Spring Boot\napplication boundary" as App
}
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector\nproduction-like persistence" as DB
component "External AI provider" as Provider <<external>>

Operator --> UI : review customer / request analysis
UI --> App : HTTP/JSON
App --> DB : JDBC / PostgreSQL\nactivity, policy, history
App ..> Provider : HTTPS\nonly when configured

note bottom of System
  Architectural context schematic (non-UML). The mandatory baseline runs without
  the external AI provider. The application is a modular monolith internally;
  module/port calls are in-process.
end note
@enduml
